# Frontend-image context — Dockerfile.frontend copies ONLY frontend/.
# The backend corpus (content/, multi-GB incl. the live-growing cisce_nodes_v2
# output) must never be uploaded for a frontend build — it made the context
# balloon from ~215MB to 4.6GB between builds (9+ min of pure transfer).
# Inherits the shared .dockerignore rules and adds the backend-only tree.
.git
.github
.env
.env.local
.env.production
*.log
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/.next*
frontend/out
frontend/_*
frontend/node_modules
**/_archive
**/tests
backend/_cache/*.tmp
backend/_cache/*_audit*.json
backend/_cache/*_backup*/
backend/_cache/*.log
deploy/tmp
*.md
!README.md
frontend/public/doodle_cards
frontend/_shots
frontend/_audit_pages.js

# backend-only trees — not referenced by Dockerfile.frontend
content/
backend/
_cisce_build/
_tmp_ctr/
*.py
*.ps1
*.sh
Dockerfile.backend
